": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "screenshot-1-startpage-2560x1440.png", "id": "1770238924289045", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_1770238927622378_8283931068911319999_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bc3BO8Wo0EcQ7kNvwHbqnre&_nc_oc=Ado2l3QJOYy2bp4h5bJNV6wvO1arX1ZI1miC2KU1eupPgBZKuTEs_d-zCHLccom_Xv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLkRqNkfoYXluaaSdm_0ajE2o2-FpIQxcOdLRnWjh8ayg&oe=6AAEB1D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-2-incognito-2560x1440.png", "id": "1466598335515689", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313107_1466598338849022_6467583840622066037_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KYyyBst66oQQ7kNvwF0tUGi&_nc_oc=AdrzCLj_X4hcAEg1F7n0lpASGWrfBUwjX8gFYaVPn9dOwj9rAdhKOMObfVgYBuTGQCQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIimxulYwoo_mWXYefpn3-YBSFdF9mUUehFyyg-lLS15Q&oe=6AAE7D50"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-3-video-2560x1440.png", "id": "1582514373488008", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825257_1582514376821341_1885589418518937397_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=434pqnRDMg4Q7kNvwG7QUB0&_nc_oc=AdqrboWnTYu7QOC3mKOkiY6hQf_VsyIr44M0L-vERj57Wt34TMs1vp0a5ys0Yojn7n4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKkKdEHcoRICMBeFDP8R5l7AuKHDPiEX5bP43pJguA3mg&oe=6AAE8098"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-4-history-2560x1440.png", "id": "1079010007897812", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_1079010014564478_1403238524400136366_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MNrfe68xkGAQ7kNvwFxABBj&_nc_oc=Adr8N2yLoKSVoXBMCEVzBP2e-jMpg4bCivVopRvtWX5f5GaDd3gjYRojQW8CWUQ4qw0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLdrczMos2Lbf8cSEWQKPoH0EVoSma8u7chKuZAmbbUIg&oe=6AAE92AD"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-bookmarks-2560x1440.png", "id": "1082165881433776", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1082165884767109_8451810117661691635_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ljgN2zy7pdgQ7kNvwEOC570&_nc_oc=AdrAPIycXnpuYhaPAB8D2sf5DR_oUf5SZWH4b4hfZhSTH0CJVzgrUyDfH2B0d4ib1d0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKzBa4gUz3dXkRrD40pIjJ1UPQozuiaqAFK80YjumqdpQ&oe=6AAE9948"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Fast Internet Browser", "keywords": ["browser", "internet", "webbrowser", "adblocker", "video"], "long_description": "Fast Internet Browser is a lightweight web browser for your headset. It opens as a floating panel that you can freely resize \u2014 from a compact window up to cinema size.\n\nBrowse the flat web, watch videos and manage your tabs in a clean, distraction-free interface. Compatible with Meta Quest.\n\nFEATURES\n\u2022 Tabs with a smart memory saver\n\u2022 Built-in blocker for known ad and tracking requests\n\u2022 Pop-up blocker\n\u2022 Search with DuckDuckGo, Google, Bing or Ecosia\n\u2022 Bookmarks and history\n\u2022 Desktop mode per tab\n\u2022 Find in page, pull to refresh, keyboard shortcuts\n\u2022 Session restore: your open tabs survive restarts\n\nPREMIUM FEATURES\n\u2022 Fullscreen video playback\n\u2022 Downloads, managed on an in-app downloads screen\n\u2022 Incognito mode: no history, and cookies from the sites you visit are deleted when the session ends\n\nNote: some DRM-protected streaming services such as Netflix are not supported, and 360\u00b0 and immersive videos are not supported yet.\n\nPRIVATE BY DESIGN\nYour history, bookmarks and settings stay on your device.\n", "short_description": "A fast, clean browser for the flat web: tabs, video, downloads and a built-in ad blocker.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://fibrowser.com/app-vr-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://fibrowser.com/app-vr-tou.html", "publisher_name": "Michael Stollenwerk", "support_website_url": null, "webs